---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Approach — TraceSeis" description="A pragmatic, physics‑grounded approach to quantitative reservoir characterization with rigorous QA and clear deliverables.">
  <section class="section wrap" id="approach">
    <h1>Our approach</h1>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Principles</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Physics‑grounded: rock, reservoir, and seismic tied quantitatively</li>
          <li>Practical: results that drive decisions under uncertainty</li>
          <li>Transparent: assumptions, constraints, and uncertainty clearly stated</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Workflow</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Data audit and QC: logs, cores, seismic, wells, horizons</li>
          <li>Rock physics modeling and feasibility</li>
          <li>Seismic processing review and conditioning</li>
          <li>Attribute analysis and inversion to reservoir properties</li>
          <li>Validation against well control and blind tests</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Quality assurance</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Independent checks, versioned inputs, reproducible notebooks</li>
          <li>Sensitivity analyses and uncertainty bounds</li>
          <li>Peer reviews with partner specialists when appropriate</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Deliverables</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Clear executive summary with decision‑focused recommendations</li>
          <li>Maps, volumes, and attributes in client formats</li>
          <li>Methodology note and reproducibility package on request</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Security & confidentiality</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Client data isolation with least‑privilege access</li>
          <li>Encrypted transit/storage using client‑approved platforms</li>
          <li>Custom NDAs and IP protection honored</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
